1
00:00:17,361 --> 00:00:24,862
When my parents left, the world fell apart,

2
00:00:24,922 --> 00:00:28,342
I stayed in the silence, cold air in my heart.

3
00:00:28,462 --> 00:00:31,602
Ground pulled away, only smoke in my hands,

4
00:00:31,702 --> 00:00:35,603
I stood before life like a stranger who can’t.

5
00:00:35,623 --> 00:00:37,703
My mother - my light, my quiet shore,

6
00:00:37,723 --> 00:00:41,863
She believed in the miracle when I spoke no more.

7
00:00:41,883 --> 00:00:44,643
My father - my stone, my shield inside,

8
00:00:44,663 --> 00:00:47,604
He spoke with his eyes, that unbreakable light.

9
00:00:47,684 --> 00:00:50,264
I live by the minutes, I breathe, I stay still,

10
00:00:50,284 --> 00:00:52,284
Met myself like spring on a frozen hill.

11
00:00:52,324 --> 00:00:54,584
No loud declarations, no rush, no race,

12
00:00:54,644 --> 00:00:57,064
Just to be, just to live, just to face.

13
00:00:57,244 --> 00:00:59,785
Centimeter by centimeter, day after day,

14
00:00:59,845 --> 00:01:02,325
I rebuild myself, fire showing the way.

15
00:01:02,365 --> 00:01:04,725
No noise, no slogans, no borrowed pose,

16
00:01:04,745 --> 00:01:07,965
I live where memory’s stronger than chains and codes.

17
00:01:07,985 --> 00:01:11,165
Death’s not an ending, it teaches to breathe,

18
00:01:11,285 --> 00:01:14,666
Love doesn’t vanish, it learns how to leave.

19
00:01:14,726 --> 00:01:17,266
In every whisper - a lesson, a trace,

20
00:01:17,306 --> 00:01:19,506
Now I live knowing death has no face.

21
00:01:19,526 --> 00:01:21,006
They were gone - and I felt erased,

22
00:01:21,026 --> 00:01:24,607
But love just moves ports, it’s never misplaced.

23
00:01:24,787 --> 00:01:27,627
I heard them speak quietly deep in my chest,

24
00:01:27,847 --> 00:01:30,267
Their eyes still alive in my permanent past.

