34
00:02:02,909 --> 00:02:05,570
Eight - hot tea, let the silence roll.

35
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:08,230
Thirteen - soup cooked slow with belief,

36
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,670
Sixteen - body work, honest relief.

37
00:02:10,730 --> 00:02:13,910
Eighteen - dinner, warmth, no talk required,

38
00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:17,991
Twenty-three - love while the rain gets tired.

39
00:02:18,111 --> 00:02:20,531
My wife - my light, my son - my drive,

40
00:02:20,611 --> 00:02:23,371
My daughter - the laugh that taught me survive.

41
00:02:23,431 --> 00:02:26,771
The market ain’t money, it’s training the core,

42
00:02:26,851 --> 00:02:29,011
Where fear burns out, darkness knocks no more.

